#. <CLT 4>外の情報に飢えている…
#. ここでテレビでも見られればな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm starving for information from the outside world.\n"
"If only there was a TV that worked...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はあ……
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな監視カメラで見張られる生活が…
#. 一体、いつまで続くんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How long am I going to be stuck here, being watched by\n"
"all these cameras...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって…なんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What's this...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あ…！
#. もしかして、ハンドルをひねって景品を出す、アレ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Oh! Maybe if I turn the knob, a prize will come out!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>自販機だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A vending machine...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一応、この辺は購買部らしいと言えるかな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I guess this must be the school store, then.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここ、購買部みたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Yup, this is definitely the school store.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、和洋折衷というか…
#. 購買というより、古物商店っぽいな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But it has kind of a Japanese/Western blend. It seems\n"
"more like a cluttered antique store...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
